                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "0ab82834-7360-383c-90ad-992024f284f3",
                        "entry_id": "4bcf1f30-cf24-3857-b006-ebe305b542a9",
                        "glosses": [
                            "советск. экон. сокр. от совет народного хозяйства; государственный орган управления народным хозяйством (промышленностью и строительством) в СССР в 1917—1932 гг. и 1957—1965 гг."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "20c187e0-a3f2-493a-af8d-54611ec0976d",
                                "sense_id": "0ab82834-7360-383c-90ad-992024f284f3",
                                "text": "Можно засадить детей шить или строгать и продавать на рынке или пускать в обмен, отдавать совнархозу за деньги, и тогда школа ничего не будет стоить."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "e382c6c2-d2d2-4376-b45a-75d5e8f1bb8a",
                                "sense_id": "0ab82834-7360-383c-90ad-992024f284f3",
                                "text": "Своего родственника по фамилии Лукич Брежнев назначил, по-моему, председателем днепропетровского совнархоза."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "5b3957c2-0b40-42ed-a84c-2aa1e30a3784",
                        "source_entry_id": "4bcf1f30-cf24-3857-b006-ebe305b542a9",
                        "source_sense_id": "0ab82834-7360-383c-90ad-992024f284f3",
                        "target_lang_word": "economic",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "economic",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "dec9ff9d-3398-3aa1-bdf7-b5917bb5b708",
                                        "entry_id": "2aaa494a-2ead-35c9-a22d-9fb30805899f",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Pertaining to an economy."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1d771db8-12a9-4a0a-86c8-cc7964afa4dd",
                                                "sense_id": "dec9ff9d-3398-3aa1-bdf7-b5917bb5b708",
                                                "text": "Economics is a messy discipline: too fluid to be a science, too rigorous to be an art. Perhaps it is fitting that economists’ most-used metric, gross domestic product (GDP), is a tangle too. GDP measures the total value of output in an economic territory. Its apparent simplicity explains why it is scrutinised down to tenths of a percentage point every month."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6625d78f-a176-464f-a104-3699df739025",
                                                "sense_id": "dec9ff9d-3398-3aa1-bdf7-b5917bb5b708",
                                                "text": "There is much talk of tyranny in the political realm, but little is said about the tyrannies in the economic realm, a primary one being the tyranny of high costs: high costs crush the economy from within and enslave those attempting to start enterprises or keep their businesses afloat."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "56f4aef1-91f2-3e2a-af58-0a95d4c5625f",
                                        "entry_id": "2aaa494a-2ead-35c9-a22d-9fb30805899f",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Frugal; cheap (in the sense of representing good value); economical."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "1c939f4b-a535-3829-a913-a352b6ea4cf8",
                                        "entry_id": "2aaa494a-2ead-35c9-a22d-9fb30805899f",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Pertaining to the study of money and its movement."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "ad0fe14a-4900-37ca-ad28-4f28fcdcd91d",
                                        "entry_id": "2aaa494a-2ead-35c9-a22d-9fb30805899f",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Pertaining to the management of a household"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "obsolete"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "98e78432-e3fc-4b82-9ece-830591ebd75a",
                                                "sense_id": "ad0fe14a-4900-37ca-ad28-4f28fcdcd91d",
                                                "text": "And doth employ her Oeconomick Art, and buisy Care, her Houshold to preserve"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
